    ['category' => 'Client Portal', 'question' => 'What can I see in the Client Portal?', 'answer' => 'Once logged in, your Dashboard shows a summary of your investments. From the sidebar you can access your Projects, Documents, Media, Payment Balance, Progress Updates, Profile settings, and Support — everything related to your investment in one place.', 'sort_order' => 30],
    ['category' => 'Client Portal', 'question' => 'How do I check my payment balance?', 'answer' => 'In the Client Portal, click "Balance" in the sidebar. You\'ll see each project/unit you own, the total contract amount, how much you\'ve paid so far, and what\'s still outstanding. A full payment history with downloadable receipts is available for each assignment.', 'sort_order' => 31],
    ['category' => 'Client Portal', 'question' => 'How do I download my project documents?', 'answer' => 'Go to "Documents" in the Client Portal sidebar. All documents shared with you (contracts, specifications, receipts, etc.) are listed there. You can search by title or filter by category. Click the download button on any document to save it to your device.', 'sort_order' => 32],
    ['category' => 'Client Portal', 'question' => 'How do I raise a support request?', 'answer' => 'In the Client Portal, click "Support" in the sidebar. Fill in the subject and your message (you can optionally link it to a specific project). The ticket goes directly to the Rockmould team and you can track its status from the same page.', 'sort_order' => 33],

