    ['category' => 'Navigating the Website', 'question' => 'How do I find information about available projects?', 'answer' => 'Click on "Projects" in the navigation menu (accessible via the hamburger menu on the top right). You can browse all projects, filter by project type or status (Ongoing, Completed, Upcoming), and search by name. Click on any project to see full details including description, milestones, gallery, and documents.', 'sort_order' => 34],
    ['category' => 'Navigating the Website', 'question' => 'How do I book a consultation?', 'answer' => 'Click "Book Consultation" on the homepage or navigate to the Consultation page. Select a consultation type, pick an available date from the calendar, choose a time slot, enter your details, and submit. You\'ll receive a confirmation email with a unique booking reference.', 'sort_order' => 35],
    ['category' => 'Navigating the Website', 'question' => 'How do I contact Rockmould?', 'answer' => 'You can reach us through the Contact page on our website, by calling the phone number in the footer, by email, or by booking a consultation online. If you\'re an existing client, you can also raise a support ticket through the Client Portal.', 'sort_order' => 36],
